# Prettier formats only the first-party JS/CSS listed in tools/lint.sh.
# HTML is excluded on purpose. Even with htmlWhitespaceSensitivity "strict",
# Prettier 3.10.1 changes the parsed DOM (checked with parse5): it re-indents
# ~1,000 whitespace text nodes (including the #preview-caption placeholder,
# which uses `white-space: pre-line`), rewraps prose in site/ by turning
# spaces into newlines, reformats the inline <script>, and rewrites a style
# attribute. It also emits hard-to-read dangling `>` hugs (`</h1\n>`).
*.html
# site/ is the marketing page; its styles follow the org-wide brand sheet.
site/
# Fusion macros, docs, and generated or vendored content.
templates/
*.md
node_modules/
.venv-dev/
dist/
build/
